'margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          风味：红布林、蔓越莓、西梅\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          Red plum, Cranberry, Prune\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          第一次采购，木瓜庄园好多年前就听闻过，一只没有机会接触到，终于如愿以偿；在普洱一个朋友店里喝到了刚烘焙好的水洗，就觉得很干净，莓果和红糖，有点类似哥伦和肯尼亚的味道；后来看到同庄园同品种还有日晒和橡木桶日晒，果断都入了一箱，做了这一期的订阅豆，大家可以横向比较看看他们三个的差异～样本刚烘焙完我感觉日晒最好喝，橡木桶日晒并没有预期的那么的酒桶和发酵，但是放了两天再喝橡木桶的发酵感跑出来了，不是很重的那种，但是很丰富，这三个共同点是都很甜和饱满，也算是给我们机会积累了一个产区的品种品尝经历空白～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\